# Downloaded mapping sources and client jars are local caches only.
#
# The ProGuard client_mappings carry a no-redistribution copyright header, so
# the raw client-<version>.txt files MUST NOT be committed or packed into the
# jar — only the generated ../..//client/src/main/resources/mappings-*.json are
# shipped. Client jars are big and likewise not redistributed.
*
!.gitignore
